<h2 id="DB_SSLMODE"><code>DB_SSLMODE</code></h2>
<p>默认值：<code>prefer</code></p>
<p>PostgreSQL 专用，<a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/10/libpq-connect.html#LIBPQ-CONNECT-SSLMODE">详情</a></p>
<h2 id="DB_TARGET_SESSION_ATTRS"><code>DB_TARGET_SESSION_ATTRS</code></h2>
<p>默认值：<code>read-write</code></p>
